From 107e911ee41ee97fcd1ca84bcc3a0888143af2b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luissalet <luismasc16@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 01:52:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/36] The samplers went live, and the reference images stop
 being dropped

The support table did its job: sampler and scheduler landed on the request,
the two false entries stopped compiling and named their own lines. Widened it
to every field the studio wants to send, and wired the four the request has
been able to carry all along - ref images, the control hint, the mask and the
hires pass were being built and thrown away between here and the gateway.
---
 src/engines/image-studio/operations.ts | 152 ++++++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 124 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

